# ==============================================================================
# ARCHITECTURAL HEADER: DALEK CAAN OMEGA EVOLUTION ENGINE - REPOSITORY HYGIENE
# ==============================================================================
# This .gitignore file establishes the boundary for the Zero-Leak Sandbox and
# repository hygiene across the multi-stack ecosystem (Node.js, Android/Kotlin,
# Firebase, and AI/ML pipelines). 
#
# Roles & Connections:
# - Prevents leak of sensitive credentials (e.g., .env, local.properties, keystores).
# - Excludes heavy build artifacts from Next.js, Gradle, and Turborepo.
# - Filters out transient AI/ML model checkpoints and local datasets.
# - Ensures IDE-specific configurations do not pollute the shared repository.
# - Integrates with 'SubstrateExclusionRegistry' for recursive entropy management.
# ==============================================================================

# Node.js & Web Build Artifacts
node_modules/
.next/
out/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
*.tsbuildinfo
*.tgz

# Monorepo & Build Caching
.turbo/

# Environment & Security (Zero-Leak Sandbox)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local
!/.env.example

# System & IDE Metadata
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

# Android, Kotlin & Native Compilation
*.iml
.gradle/
.kotlin/
/local.properties
local.properties
/build/
captures/
.externalNativeBuild/
.cxx/
debug.keystore
*.apk
*.aab

# AI / Machine Learning Assets & Data
data/
models/
checkpoints/
*.pt
*.onnx
*.h5
*.pkl
*.bin
__pycache__/
*.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Firebase Services
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log
firebase-debug.*.log

# Dalek Caan Ω Substrate Registry Extensions
# Managed by SubstrateExclusionRegistry
.substrate-entropy-barrier
.recursive-deity-cache